! Streams Extras

No user-configurable settings yet. The plugin's behaviour is fixed:

* The ''`Copy ▸`'' / ''`Paste ▸`'' cascade renders at the bottom of the streams contextmenu, above the Keyboard Shortcuts row.
* The structure clipboard lives at <code>$:/state/rimir/streams-extras/clipboard/structure</code> — text field is the JSON, persists across reloads. Clear it manually by deleting the tiddler if you want a fresh state.
* New stream nodes from a paste are titled <code>&lt;target&gt;/node-&lt;timestamp&gt;-N</code> (TW's <code>generateNewTitle</code> appends a counter to keep titles unique).
* Pasted nodes from a structure copy carry an ''`orig-tiddler`'' field pointing at the source title. Pastes from clipboard text don't set this field.

''Diagnostics:'' inspect the structure clipboard state directly to confirm a Copy succeeded:

